   Advanced Physics&nbsp;ML:   &nbsp;Graduate research focused on AI for scientific simulation, experience solving inverse problems (geometry optimization/design under uncertainty), and hands-on experience building active learning or adaptive sampling pipelines.  &nbsp;  
   Domain Expertise:   &nbsp;Prior work in aerospace, automotive, turbomachinery, or another simulation-heavy hardware domain, with familiarity in commercial solvers, meshing tools, and CAD interoperability.  
